OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary to consider Parades
OL,4,ACommission letter over Drumcree
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has said he will take time to
OL,8,Fconsider a letter from the Parades
OL,9,FCommission on how they plan to restore
OL,10,Fpublic confidence.
OL,12,FIt comes after a commissioner resigned
OL,13,Fover the handling of its ruling on the
OL,14,FOrange Order's Drumcree parade.
OL,16,FThe commission was asked to write to
OL,17,FSir Chris by the end of the day to
OL,18,Fassure him that their decision making
OL,19,Fprocesses were fair after a court case
OL,20,Fhighlighted mistakes over the ruling on
OL,21,Fthe annual parade.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
